   "fact_id": "F001",
   "statement": "The genus name Zulmasuchus means \"Zulma Gasparini's crocodile\".",
   "category": "discovery",
   "chunk_id": "zulmasuchus:enwiki:2",
   "lang": "en",
   "quote": "Zulmasuchus (meaning \"Zulma Gasparini's crocodile\") is an extinct genus of sebecid sebecosuchian mesoeucrocodylian.",
